From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:00:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Interfaces: achievement diary journals (Lumbridge & Draynor,
 Varrock)

Open <area> Journal in the Achievement Diaries side tab (area_task) opens the
journal scroll (741) with the area's tasks per tier, word-wrapped by p12
widths. RuneLite's Diary Requirements plugin appends each task's skill and
quest requirements to these lines.
